			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">As many of you may have noticed using the chronicles theme, there are HP, MP and XP as well as levels under the poster's name... here's an explanation of it from the mod developer.
<br />

<br />
</span><table width="90%" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3" border="0" align="center"><tr> 	  <td><span class="genmed"><b>Quote:</b></span></td>	</tr>	<tr>	  <td class="quote"><span style="font-weight: bold">Description:</span> This mod adds an rpg-like level, hp, mp, and exp rating  to a user's profile, and under their name in their posts.
<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Level: </span>a user's level is based on how many posts the user has made.
<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">HP:</span> represents how active the user is. max hp is based off level,
<br />
current hp is based on how often the user posts.
<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">MP:</span> represnts how quickly the user posts. Max mp is based on level, each post costs mp, and mp regenerates over time.
<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Exp:</span> a percentage showing how many more posts the user has to make to get to the next level.
<br />
</td>	</tr></table><span class="postbody"><br />_________________<br /><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: normal"><span style="color: purple">Qallain Spirefell</span></span>
<br />
<span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: normal">Enchanter of the 48th circle
<br />
Elder and scribe to Concordat Angelis</span></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
